{"reviewId": "79340619_84e6KLN6F", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "这句话意思是中国崛起是虚的，而是世界经济繁荣给了中国做代工的机会，带动中国经济变好的。零几年那会确实是这样，但是我觉得这几年不是了，中国现在的科技创新也很厉害，自主替代如火如荼，成为世界经济引领的角色了", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "13237-13279", "abstract": "中国崛起”这种说法不过是被世界产业转移和世界经济周期繁荣带动的中国经济高增长迷惑了。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 8, "chapterName": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "chapterIdx": 8, "reviewId": "79340619_84e6KLN6F", "userVid": 79340619, "topics": [], "createTime": 1761608695, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "author": {"userVid": 79340619, "name": "小田", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0013-oOvnQua2izEMSk4nD0ttNfc/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "找到自己", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-1000", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 1000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 13, "likes": [{"userVid": 405462199, "name": "🐳", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/1NNqAicj84180LdobMIOrLgDz7F6MkvYqGRqYaE0QUZDqUQhA2NUM7MdTMKMBj9gV8bO7QXfG9IA/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20230904-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "引领…\n", "reviewId": "79340619_84e6KLN6F", "commentId": "79340619_84e6KLN6F_c4727762_8976Ds9sP", "userVid": 4727762, "createTime": 1778819058, "author": {"userVid": 